#     at 371b52d142968ff09e9cb5275a75eae55aa27a96.
#
# Format: "<sha256>  <repo-relative path>", i.e. the same layout as the
# output of `sha256sum`. Lines beginning with # and blank lines are ignored.
# Paths are unique across the two repos (det/, rec/ vs onnx/, *.json).
#
# To regenerate after a model revision bump:  textsnap --generate-checksums

